      "text": "Expelled JD(U) MLA Anant Singh, popularly known as 'Chhote Sarkar', is preparing for a grand wedding celebration for his daughter Shivangi in Bihar on November 25. Singh says invitations are being extended to people across India and Pakistan, as well as politicians from both the ruling establishment and Opposition, including Prime Minister Narendra Modi, Nitish Kumar and Lalu Prasad Yadav. Arrested in October 2025 in connection with the murder of Dular Chand Yadav, Singh was granted bail in March 2026. The Supreme Court has now directed him to surrender by December 1, just six days after the wedding",
